{"title": "Abyss Beckoners", "pageid": 8142, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Abyss_Beckoners", "categories": ["Bugs", "Gloves", "Very rare items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"> \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-veryrare\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Gloves_Leather_F_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/95/Gloves_Leather_F_Faded.png/300px-Gloves_Leather_F_Faded.png.webp, /w/images/9/95/Gloves_Leather_F_Faded.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Abyss Beckoners image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/95/Gloves_Leather_F_Faded.png/300px-Gloves_Leather_F_Faded.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/95/Gloves_Leather_F_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p>The <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\"><span style=\"color: #D1017B ;\">Abyss Beckoners</span></a> are a very rare pair of <a href=\"/wiki/Handwear\" title=\"Handwear\">gloves</a>. They improve the <a href=\"/wiki/Resistance\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Resistance\">damage resistance</a> of the wearer's summons at the risk of driving them <a href=\"/wiki/Demonspirit_Madness_(Condition)\" title=\"Demonspirit Madness (Condition)\">Mad</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>Demons will bite their masters, slaves, comrades, and, on occasion, themselves. They bite on principle, and are functionally piranha with extra steps.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\" style=\"margin-left: 7px\"> \n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gloves\" title=\"Gloves\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fa/Gloves_Icon.png/25px-Gloves_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fa/Gloves_Icon.png/38px-Gloves_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fa/Gloves_Icon.png/50px-Gloves_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Gloves\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fa/Gloves_Icon.png/25px-Gloves_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fa/Gloves_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Gloves\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Gloves\">Gloves</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Very rare\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: <span style=\"color: #D1017B ;\">Very rare</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 0.5 kg (1 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 0.5 kg (1 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 450 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  450  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">MAG_Zhentarim_Demonspirit_Gloves</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_Zhentarim_Demonspirit_Gloves\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_Zhentarim_Demonspirit_Gloves\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">7ef359b6-79af-4414-99bc-f93bc5eeed77</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:7ef359b6-79af-4414-99bc-f93bc5eeed77\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:7ef359b6-79af-4414-99bc-f93bc5eeed77\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>Stats</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">MAG_Zhentarim_Demonspirit_Gloves</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_Zhentarim_Demonspirit_Gloves+type:stat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_Zhentarim_Demonspirit_Gloves+type:stat\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>File</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">ARM_Gloves_Leather_F</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"></span></li></ul>\n</div> \n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Special\">Special</span></h3>\n<p>The wearer of this item gains:\n\n</p>\n<dl><dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Demonspirit_Aura\" title=\"Demonspirit Aura\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/36/Generic_Wild_Animal_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Wild_Animal_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/36/Generic_Wild_Animal_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Wild_Animal_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/36/Generic_Wild_Animal_Icon.webp/80px-Generic_Wild_Animal_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Demonspirit Aura\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/36/Generic_Wild_Animal_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Wild_Animal_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/36/Generic_Wild_Animal_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Demonspirit_Aura\" title=\"Demonspirit Aura\">Demonspirit Aura</a></span></dt><dd>The wearer's summoned creatures have <a href=\"/wiki/Resistance\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Resistance\">resistance</a> to all damage except <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Psychic\" title=\"Psychic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/25px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/38px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/50px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Psychic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/25px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Psychic\" title=\"Psychic\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-psychic\">Psychic</span></a> damage.\n\nAt the start of the summoned creatures turn, it must succeed a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Wisdom saving throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wisdom\" title=\"Wisdom\">Wisdom</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving throw\">saving throw</a> or be driven <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Demonspirit_Madness_(Condition)\" title=\"Demonspirit Madness (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/36/Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/36/Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/36/Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Mad\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/36/Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/36/Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Demonspirit_Madness_(Condition)\" title=\"Demonspirit Madness (Condition)\">Mad</a>.</dd></dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>    \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Zhentarim_Basement\" title=\"Zhentarim Basement\">Zhentarim Basement</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;306&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-170</span>: Inside a locked chest in a cell</li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>The following summons are innately immune to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Demonspirit_Madness_(Condition)\" title=\"Demonspirit Madness (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/36/Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/36/Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/36/Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Demonspirit Madness\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/36/Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/36/Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Demonspirit_Madness_(Condition)\" title=\"Demonspirit Madness (Condition)\">Demonspirit Madness</a>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Accursed_Spectre_(reaction)\" title=\"Accursed Spectre (reaction)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/aa/Accursed_Spectre_Icon.webp/25px-Accursed_Spectre_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/aa/Accursed_Spectre_Icon.webp/38px-Accursed_Spectre_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/aa/Accursed_Spectre_Icon.webp/50px-Accursed_Spectre_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Accursed Spectres\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/aa/Accursed_Spectre_Icon.webp/25px-Accursed_Spectre_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/aa/Accursed_Spectre_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Accursed_Spectre_(reaction)\" title=\"Accursed Spectre (reaction)\">Accursed Spectres</a> from the <a href=\"/wiki/The_Hexblade\" title=\"The Hexblade\">The Hexblade's</a> ability.</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ghoul\" title=\"Ghoul\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2a/Portrait_Ghoul.png/25px-Portrait_Ghoul.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2a/Portrait_Ghoul.png/38px-Portrait_Ghoul.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2a/Portrait_Ghoul.png/50px-Portrait_Ghoul.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ghouls\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2a/Portrait_Ghoul.png/25px-Portrait_Ghoul.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2a/Portrait_Ghoul.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ghoul\" title=\"Ghoul\">Ghouls</a> summoned through <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Danse_Macabre\" title=\"Danse Macabre\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/92/Danse_Macabre_Icon.webp/25px-Danse_Macabre_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/92/Danse_Macabre_Icon.webp/38px-Danse_Macabre_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/92/Danse_Macabre_Icon.webp/50px-Danse_Macabre_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Danse Macabre\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/92/Danse_Macabre_Icon.webp/25px-Danse_Macabre_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/92/Danse_Macabre_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Danse_Macabre\" title=\"Danse Macabre\">Danse Macabre</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Animate_Dead:_Ghoul\" title=\"Animate Dead: Ghoul\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4f/Animate_Dead_Ghoul_Icon.webp/25px-Animate_Dead_Ghoul_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4f/Animate_Dead_Ghoul_Icon.webp/38px-Animate_Dead_Ghoul_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4f/Animate_Dead_Ghoul_Icon.webp/50px-Animate_Dead_Ghoul_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Animate Dead: Ghoul\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4f/Animate_Dead_Ghoul_Icon.webp/25px-Animate_Dead_Ghoul_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4f/Animate_Dead_Ghoul_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Animate_Dead:_Ghoul\" title=\"Animate Dead: Ghoul\">Animate Dead: Ghoul</a>, or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Animate_Dead:_Flying_Ghoul\" title=\"Animate Dead: Flying Ghoul\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4f/Animate_Dead_Ghoul_Icon.webp/25px-Animate_Dead_Ghoul_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4f/Animate_Dead_Ghoul_Icon.webp/38px-Animate_Dead_Ghoul_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4f/Animate_Dead_Ghoul_Icon.webp/50px-Animate_Dead_Ghoul_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Animate Dead: Flying Ghoul\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4f/Animate_Dead_Ghoul_Icon.webp/25px-Animate_Dead_Ghoul_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4f/Animate_Dead_Ghoul_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Animate_Dead:_Flying_Ghoul\" title=\"Animate Dead: Flying Ghoul\">Animate Dead: Flying Ghoul</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mummy\" title=\"Mummy\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f1/Portrait_Mummy.png/25px-Portrait_Mummy.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f1/Portrait_Mummy.png/38px-Portrait_Mummy.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f1/Portrait_Mummy.png/50px-Portrait_Mummy.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Mummies\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f1/Portrait_Mummy.png/25px-Portrait_Mummy.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f1/Portrait_Mummy.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Mummy\" title=\"Mummy\">Mummies</a> from <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Create_Undead\" title=\"Create Undead\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/da/Create_Undead_Icon.webp/25px-Create_Undead_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/da/Create_Undead_Icon.webp/38px-Create_Undead_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/da/Create_Undead_Icon.webp/50px-Create_Undead_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Create Undead\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/da/Create_Undead_Icon.webp/25px-Create_Undead_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/da/Create_Undead_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Create_Undead\" title=\"Create Undead\">Create Undead</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dryad\" title=\"Dryad\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/36/Portrait_Dryad.png/25px-Portrait_Dryad.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/36/Portrait_Dryad.png/38px-Portrait_Dryad.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/36/Portrait_Dryad.png/50px-Portrait_Dryad.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Dryads\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/36/Portrait_Dryad.png/25px-Portrait_Dryad.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/36/Portrait_Dryad.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dryad\" title=\"Dryad\">Dryads</a> from <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Conjure_Woodland_Being\" title=\"Conjure Woodland Being\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8a/Conjure_Woodland_Being_Icon.webp/25px-Conjure_Woodland_Being_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8a/Conjure_Woodland_Being_Icon.webp/38px-Conjure_Woodland_Being_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8a/Conjure_Woodland_Being_Icon.webp/50px-Conjure_Woodland_Being_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Conjure Woodland Being\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8a/Conjure_Woodland_Being_Icon.webp/25px-Conjure_Woodland_Being_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8a/Conjure_Woodland_Being_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Conjure_Woodland_Being\" title=\"Conjure Woodland Being\">Conjure Woodland Being</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wood_Woad\" title=\"Wood Woad\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/24/Portrait_Wood_Woad.png/25px-Portrait_Wood_Woad.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/24/Portrait_Wood_Woad.png/38px-Portrait_Wood_Woad.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/24/Portrait_Wood_Woad.png/50px-Portrait_Wood_Woad.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Wood Woads\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/24/Portrait_Wood_Woad.png/25px-Portrait_Wood_Woad.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/24/Portrait_Wood_Woad.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wood_Woad\" title=\"Wood Woad\">Wood Woads</a> summoned by dryads through <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fallen_Lover\" title=\"Fallen Lover\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/52/Fallen_Lover_Icon.webp/25px-Fallen_Lover_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/52/Fallen_Lover_Icon.webp/38px-Fallen_Lover_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/52/Fallen_Lover_Icon.webp/50px-Fallen_Lover_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fallen Lover\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/52/Fallen_Lover_Icon.webp/25px-Fallen_Lover_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/52/Fallen_Lover_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Fallen_Lover\" title=\"Fallen Lover\">Fallen Lover</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Flaming_Sphere\" title=\"Flaming Sphere\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/66/Flaming_Sphere_Icon.webp/25px-Flaming_Sphere_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/66/Flaming_Sphere_Icon.webp/38px-Flaming_Sphere_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/66/Flaming_Sphere_Icon.webp/50px-Flaming_Sphere_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Flaming Sphere\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/66/Flaming_Sphere_Icon.webp/25px-Flaming_Sphere_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/66/Flaming_Sphere_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Flaming_Sphere\" title=\"Flaming Sphere\">Flaming Sphere</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Spiritual_Weapon\" title=\"Spiritual Weapon\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Spiritual_Weapon_Icon.webp/25px-Spiritual_Weapon_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/26/Spiritual_Weapon_Icon.webp/38px-Spiritual_Weapon_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/26/Spiritual_Weapon_Icon.webp/50px-Spiritual_Weapon_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Spiritual Weapon\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Spiritual_Weapon_Icon.webp/25px-Spiritual_Weapon_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Spiritual_Weapon_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Spiritual_Weapon\" title=\"Spiritual Weapon\">Spiritual Weapon</a></li></ul></li>\n<li>The following summons have a sufficiently high Wisdom saving throw bonus to be effectively immune to Demonspirit Madness. It is not possible to critically fail normal saving throws (except <a href=\"/wiki/Concentration\" title=\"Concentration\">Concentration</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_throws#Death_saving_throws\" title=\"Saving throws\">Death saving throws</a>), so a +9 Wisdom saving throw bonus is sufficient to always succeed the saving throw.\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Deva\" title=\"Deva\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bd/Portrait_Deva.png/25px-Portrait_Deva.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/bd/Portrait_Deva.png/38px-Portrait_Deva.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/bd/Portrait_Deva.png/50px-Portrait_Deva.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Devas\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bd/Portrait_Deva.png/25px-Portrait_Deva.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/bd/Portrait_Deva.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Deva\" title=\"Deva\">Devas</a> from <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Planar_Ally:_Deva\" title=\"Planar Ally: Deva\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f3/Planar_Ally_Icon.webp/25px-Planar_Ally_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f3/Planar_Ally_Icon.webp/38px-Planar_Ally_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f3/Planar_Ally_Icon.webp/50px-Planar_Ally_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Planar Ally: Deva\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f3/Planar_Ally_Icon.webp/25px-Planar_Ally_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f3/Planar_Ally_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Planar_Ally:_Deva\" title=\"Planar Ally: Deva\">Planar Ally: Deva</a> or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sights_of_the_Seelie:_Summon_Deva\" title=\"Sights of the Seelie: Summon Deva\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d8/Sights_of_the_Seelie_Summon_Deva_Icon.webp/25px-Sights_of_the_Seelie_Summon_Deva_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d8/Sights_of_the_Seelie_Summon_Deva_Icon.webp/38px-Sights_of_the_Seelie_Summon_Deva_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d8/Sights_of_the_Seelie_Summon_Deva_Icon.webp/50px-Sights_of_the_Seelie_Summon_Deva_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sights of the Seelie: Summon Deva\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d8/Sights_of_the_Seelie_Summon_Deva_Icon.webp/25px-Sights_of_the_Seelie_Summon_Deva_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d8/Sights_of_the_Seelie_Summon_Deva_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sights_of_the_Seelie:_Summon_Deva\" title=\"Sights of the Seelie: Summon Deva\">Sights of the Seelie: Summon Deva</a></li></ul></li>\n<li>The following summons lack the <code>SUMMON</code> tag and are entirely unaffected by Demonspirit Aura:\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Guardian_of_Faith\" title=\"Guardian of Faith\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Guardian_of_Faith_Icon.webp/25px-Guardian_of_Faith_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Guardian_of_Faith_Icon.webp/38px-Guardian_of_Faith_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Guardian_of_Faith_Icon.webp/50px-Guardian_of_Faith_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Guardian of Faith\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Guardian_of_Faith_Icon.webp/25px-Guardian_of_Faith_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7d/Guardian_of_Faith_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Guardian_of_Faith\" title=\"Guardian of Faith\">Guardian of Faith</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Grasping_Vine\" title=\"Grasping Vine\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8b/Grasping_Vine_Icon.webp/25px-Grasping_Vine_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8b/Grasping_Vine_Icon.webp/38px-Grasping_Vine_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8b/Grasping_Vine_Icon.webp/50px-Grasping_Vine_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Grasping Vine\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8b/Grasping_Vine_Icon.webp/25px-Grasping_Vine_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8b/Grasping_Vine_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Grasping_Vine\" title=\"Grasping Vine\">Grasping Vine</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n\n<p><i>Regarding Demonspirit Aura:</i></p>\n<ul><li>Though not stated ingame, the aura is visible as a red circle; it emanates from the wearer with a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/25px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/38px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"AoE: 9 m / 30 ft (Radius)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/25px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> AoE: 9 m / 30 ft (Radius).</li>\n<li>Summoned creatures which are otherwise immune to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Charmed_(Condition)\" title=\"Charmed (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/47/Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/47/Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/47/Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Charmed\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/47/Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/47/Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Charmed_(Condition)\" title=\"Charmed (Condition)\">Charmed</a> (such as <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Calmed_(Condition)\" title=\"Calmed (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fb/Calmed_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Calmed_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fb/Calmed_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Calmed_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fb/Calmed_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Calmed_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Calmed\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fb/Calmed_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Calmed_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fb/Calmed_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Calmed_(Condition)\" title=\"Calmed (Condition)\">Calmed</a> or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Aura_of_Devotion_(Condition)\" title=\"Aura of Devotion (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Aura_of_Devotion_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Aura_of_Devotion_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Aura_of_Devotion_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Aura_of_Devotion_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Aura_of_Devotion_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Aura_of_Devotion_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Aura of Devotion\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Aura_of_Devotion_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Aura_of_Devotion_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Aura_of_Devotion_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Aura_of_Devotion_(Condition)\" title=\"Aura of Devotion (Condition)\">Aura of Devotion</a>) cannot go <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Demonspirit_Madness_(Condition)\" title=\"Demonspirit Madness (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/36/Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/36/Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/36/Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"mad\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/36/Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/36/Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Demonspirit_Madness_(Condition)\" title=\"Demonspirit Madness (Condition)\">mad</a>.</li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>The description of Demonspirit Aura includes a tooltip link to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Crown_of_Madness_(Condition)\" title=\"Crown of Madness (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/36/Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/36/Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/36/Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Crown of Madness\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/36/Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-